# OWNERS: owners per directory (an OWNERS file in a subdirectory takes precedence)
# Format: <path-glob> <owner> [<owner>...]
# Contracts and patches have their own approval groups.

*                       dev-chamomile
contracts/**            dev-chamomile   # contract changes: approval from the OWNERS of both layers required
third_party/**/patches  dev-chamomile   # patch governance
